the analytical check to move only the records whose environment varies
(\code{unc_ok = FALSE}), keeping environmentally uniform records fixed, so
that the replicates differ only where it matters; with
\code{\link[=uncertainty_environment]{uncertainty_environment()}} the workflow becomes keep (uniform), propagate
(variable) or drop (radius above \code{max_radius_km}).
